Sval: Remove Firefox View

Sval never built about:firefoxview and hid its button and menu item, so
the window handler, the hidden tab it kept, its startup hooks, quick
action, telemetry, prefs and tests only stood in other code's way. The
open-tabs modules and the tab list that the split view's tab picker
(about:opentabs) and the sidebar's history, bookmarks and open-tabs
panels share stay in browser/components/firefoxview, with the strings
those use.

